{"n":72,"ayahs":[{"w":["قُلۡ","أُوحِيَ","إِلَيَّ","أَنَّهُ","ٱسۡتَمَعَ","نَفَرࣱ","مِّنَ","ٱلۡجِنِّ","فَقَالُوٓاْ","إِنَّا","سَمِعۡنَا","قُرۡءَانًا","عَجَبࣰا"],"en":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"It has been revealed to me that a group of the jinn listened and said, 'Indeed, we have heard an amazing Qur'an","g":["Say","It has been revealed","to me","that","listened","a group","of","the jinn","and they said","Indeed, we","heard","a Quran","amazing"],"t":["qul","ūḥiya","ilayya","annahu","is'tamaʿa","nafarun","mina","l-jini","faqālū","innā","samiʿ'nā","qur'ānan","ʿajaban"],"ws":{"alafasy":[40,420,1150,1900,3210,4020,5270,5520,6750,8980,10140,11150,12270],"sudais":[240,560,1320,2050,2860,3680,4800,5040,6000,7020,7860,8860,10060],"shuraim":[100,330,980,1590,2420,3080,3900,4170,5040,5910,6720,7530,8510],"husary":[550,1050,2230,3390,4880,6100,7690,8200,9680,12320,14000,15690,17540],"basit":[2550,2780,4150,5860,7700,9510,10630,12080,14250,17430,19410,21660,24150]}},{"w":["يَهۡدِيٓ","إِلَى","ٱلرُّشۡدِ","فَـَٔامَنَّا","بِهِۦۖ","وَلَن","نُّشۡرِكَ","بِرَبِّنَآ","أَحَدࣰا"],"en":"It guides to the right course, and we have believed in it. And we will never associate with our Lord anyone","g":["It guides","to","the right way","so we believe","in it","and never","we will associate","with our Lord","anyone"],"t":["yahdī","ilā","l-rush'di","faāmannā","bihi","walan","nush'rika","birabbinā","aḥadan"],"ws":{"alafasy":[100,2410,2710,3460,5440,6310,7490,8150,8920],"sudais":[350,1100,1380,2030,3340,4000,4670,5390,6590],"shuraim":[170,960,1070,1650,3020,3580,3930,4860,5780],"husary":[60,2340,2830,4170,6970,9560,9940,11940,13440],"basit":[1450,3690,4200,5690,9030,10230,12040,13530,17070]}},{"w":["وَأَنَّهُۥ","تَعَٰلَىٰ","جَدُّ","رَبِّنَا","مَا","ٱتَّخَذَ","صَٰحِبَةࣰ","وَلَا","وَلَدࣰا"],"en":"And [it teaches] that exalted is the nobleness of our Lord; He has not taken a wife or a son","g":["And that He ","Exalted is","(the) Majesty","(of) our Lord ","not","He has taken","a wife","and not","a son"],"t":["wa-annahu","taʿālā","jaddu","rabbinā","mā","ittakhadha","ṣāḥibatan","walā","waladan"],"ws":{"alafasy":[30,1610,2580,3190,4160,4320,5060,6200,7620],"sudais":[160,1460,2500,3080,3960,4120,4880,5980,6850],"shuraim":[100,1090,1930,2450,3210,3340,3970,5050,5620],"husary":[900,2850,4470,5420,6980,7200,8460,10890,11920],"basit":[1250,3430,5510,6760,8880,9120,10790,13100,15130]}},{"w":["وَأَنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","يَقُولُ","سَفِيهُنَا","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","شَطَطࣰا"],"en":"And that our foolish one has been saying about Allah an excessive transgression","g":["And that he","used to","speak ","the foolish among us","against","Allah","an excessive transgression"],"t":["wa-annahu","kāna","yaqūlu","safīhunā","ʿalā","l-lahi","shaṭaṭan"],"ws":{"alafasy":[30,1600,2200,2970,4010,4510,5240],"sudais":[110,1420,2060,2840,4000,4380,5150],"shuraim":[100,1160,1650,2280,3150,3600,4190],"husary":[850,2810,3840,5100,7130,7890,9120],"basit":[2450,4870,6160,7710,10120,11090,12600]}},{"w":["وَأَنَّا","ظَنَنَّآ","أَن","لَّن","تَقُولَ","ٱلۡإِنسُ","وَٱلۡجِنُّ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","كَذِبࣰا"],"en":"And we had thought that mankind and the jinn would never speak about Allah a lie","g":["And that we","thought","that","never","will say","the men","and the jinn","against","Allah","any lie"],"t":["wa-annā","ẓanannā","an","lan","taqūla","l-insu","wal-jinu","ʿalā","l-lahi","kadhiban"],"ws":{"alafasy":[50,1450,4190,4810,5790,6570,7990,9300,9720,10490],"sudais":[140,1280,2540,2680,3560,4340,5420,6720,7120,7950],"shuraim":[80,1020,2090,2210,2870,3520,4450,5380,5750,6370],"husary":[100,2000,3720,5550,6970,8380,10120,11970,12660,14040],"basit":[800,2930,6490,6750,8450,10120,12500,14860,15760,17440]}},{"w":["وَأَنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","رِجَالࣱ","مِّنَ","ٱلۡإِنسِ","يَعُوذُونَ","بِرِجَالࣲ","مِّنَ","ٱلۡجِنِّ","فَزَادُوهُمۡ","رَهَقࣰا"],"en":"And there were men from mankind who sought refuge in men from the jinn, so they [only] increased them in burden","g":["And that","(there) were","men","among","mankind","who sought re